// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Dominatrix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P520930737" "Being the daughter of a famous and universally loved super heroine never sat well with Dominatrix. She rebelled from a very young age and when she hit puberty and her powers kicked in she decided enough was enough. After killing her mother, the infamous Miss Liberty, she started making a name for herself. She caught Tyrants attention and has been serving him loyally, in all capacities, ever since."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P2422410067" "Dominatrix"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3377574802" "To be bound to Dominatrix is an honor that must be earned. Going without sleep and other trials of endurance are given to candidates to prove their worth. Passing means a term of servitude where complete obedience is expected."
// DisplayNames :
"P4281183305" "Servant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3464287763" "Trainers are very important to Dominatrix's organization. They teach the new Servants to fight effectively and work as a unit. They also fill the position of tactical leader in combat quite often."
// DisplayNames :
"P178794940" "Trainer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1283744673" "The Lady is the mistress of all she surveys. She is responsible for a number of Trainers and Servants. There is a strong bond of fealty that goes both ways in these relationships. With power comes responsibility."
// DisplayNames :
"P2447113909" "Lady"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Nictus_Hunter_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4110108135" "Quantum Servant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P25090066" "Quantum Trainer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dominatrix_Nictus_Hunter_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3730514085" "QuantumLady"

