// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Neuron_Neuron 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1097081295" "Neuron is the creation of his own twisted scientific experiment. He gave himself complete control over his body's nervous system. Once he and Anti-Matter worked together as friends but of late a rift has formed between them. Neuron's creation of Siege and the favor that garnered him with Tyrant is the primary cause of discord between them."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P3707696793" "Neuron"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Neuron_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2512105509" "The basic model of minion designed by Neuron was originally blueprinted to be a laboratory assistant. It is excellent at following simple commands and would have been well suited for tasks a scientist did not have the time or muscle for. Neuron quickly realized that the metallic minions could be used as attack drones and adapted his plans on the fly."
// DisplayNames :
"P268460245" "Electrode"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Neuron_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1347516319" "A more powerful version of the Electrode unit, this minion can sometimes cause trouble for a single opponent. A group should be able to easily defeat it however due to its limited power supply. It has excellent offensive capabilities and should be dealt with carefully if more than one is present."
// DisplayNames :
"P3701000762" "Circuit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Neuron_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3992113321" "The Inhibitors are sometimes said to be the most difficult of Neurons creations to deal with. They are built to make it difficult for any opponent to do what they are good at. This ability to negate the strengths of their foe make the Inhibitors a frustrating, and potentially deadly opponent."
// DisplayNames :
"P1823568955" "Inhibitor"

