// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Nightstar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P510360342" "This android is the creation of Anti-Matter as a testament to his love for Dominatrix. Nightstar is patterned after her in the same way that Siege is patterned after Tyrant. Neuron considers it an inferior design but Anti-Matter knows that one day victory will be his."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P1442804768" "Nightstar"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1170404789" "Not to be out done by Neuron, Anti-matter created the SPECial Tactical Robot Army to serve Tyrant. The Series I was the prototype and is therefore the least efficient model."
// DisplayNames :
"P3136061084" "SPECTRA Series I"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1507086744" "When Neuron developed a new Robotic Attack Module series, Anti-matter did the same with the SPECTRA. Despite certain design differences the two models are comparable in practice."
// DisplayNames :
"P604054952" "SPECTRA Series II"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P77451034" "The SPECTRA Series III is the most advanced design that Anti-matter has created to date. Some of his other creations are more powerful but none have the efficiency of the Series III."
// DisplayNames :
"P86719558" "SPECTRA Series III"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Nictus_Hunter_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4035480797" "SPECTRA Series I Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P338820410" "SPECTRA Series II Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstar_Nictus_Hunter_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P716911504" "SPECTRA Series III Quantum"

